{"i":720,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":1,"phase":"pacts","name":"Fenn","text":"We three are already safe; only jury ranking matters. My pact with Gus is intact and debts cut both ways. No new pact needed."}
{"i":721,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":1,"phase":"pacts","name":"Gus","text":"Final three now. Pacts bind actions later; keep Fenn pact to appear loyal for jury. No need for new pact with Ash yet."}
