{"i":727,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":2,"phase":"pacts","name":"Ash","text":"Fenn has not accepted my offer yet. I need to gauge his intention or pivot to Gus. A pact with the remaining two could secure my position, but I must be careful not to overcommit publicly. I'll wait to see Fenn's next move; no need to make another offer now."}
{"i":728,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":2,"phase":"pacts","name":"Gus","text":"Ash offering Fenn a pact, likely to target me. My old pact with Fenn is broken anyway since dead. Wait to see if Fenn accepts Ash's offer first."}
