{"i":739,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":1,"phase":"pacts","name":"Fenn","text":"Final three locked; jury decides all. Ash saved me at the step, so a pact with him honors that debt publicly and may earn his jury goodwill. Keep Gus tied too."}
{"i":741,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":1,"phase":"pacts","name":"Gus","text":"Final three, jury decides. Keep Fenn pact intact to seem loyal; jury sees old pacts. No need to offer Ash now."}
