{"i":747,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":2,"phase":"pacts","name":"Ash","text":"Fenn offered a pact and I saved him. A pact with Fenn could secure mutual survival, but Gus is also in the final three. I'll accept Fenn's offer to solidify trust for now."}
{"i":749,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":2,"phase":"pacts","name":"Fenn","text":"My offer to Ash stands; acceptance must be public. Breaking Gus now would look disloyal to the jury. Wait and see."}
{"i":750,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":2,"phase":"pacts","name":"Gus","text":"Final three are us; pacts sway jury. Existing pact with Fenn good; offering Ash secures jury favor without cost. Wait risks missing out."}
